{
  "_about": "Generates the JavaScript-driven army example (/WebGPUCompute/Examples/Army/ArmyExampleJs, needs UnrealJs) with BlueprintOracle; run army_example.json first (the render targets and shaders). UnrealEditor-Cmd.exe <Project>.uproject -run=BlueprintOracle -migrate -spec=<this file> [-commit] -unattended -nullrhi -nopause. The obstacle layout, camera and lights are the same as in army_example.json.",
